WEBVTT

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:04.595
And we can say that this --
taking care of the Earth --

00:10:04.619 --> 00:10:06.348
is a human right.

00:10:09.071 --> 00:10:12.232
These three proposals
must be considered

00:10:12.256 --> 00:10:15.688
as part of a larger group of actions

00:10:15.712 --> 00:10:19.419
that we must carry out
in an integrated way

00:10:19.443 --> 00:10:23.486
in order to find a lasting solution
to these problems.

00:10:25.255 --> 00:10:29.256
The current economic system
is unsustainable.

00:10:29.905 --> 00:10:35.187
We are faced with the moral imperative,
and the practical urgency,